OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of Santas taking part in
OL,4,Afestive fun runs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Father Christmases will
OL,7,Ftake to the streets across the region
OL,8,Fthis festive season.
OL,10,FLincoln Santa Fun Run, the UK's
OL,11,Fsecond-longest running such event, will
OL,12,Fsee about 2,000 people dressed as
OL,13,FFather Christmas running through the
OL,14,Fcity on 13 December.
OL,16,F"We always have lots of laughter and
OL,17,Ffun and people really enjoying it. It's
OL,18,Fsuch a great spectacle to watch,"
OL,19,Forganiser Doug Scott said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
